rance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T05:40:23-08:00","id":1429338,"title":"","content":"There's an old film from the 1960s, one of the few really good films George Hamilton was ever in, called The Power. It's both interesting as a horror film with a hidden Nova for the monster ( hidden from those around him, not the audience) and for a character discovering their power and becoming a monster in their turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T11:38:49-08:00","id":1429399,"title":"","content":"May depend some on genre or era of play but how about &quot;Saved by the Bell&quot;? I am pretty sure Zack Morris is a powerful talent.<br /> <br /> Similarly, &quot;Happy Days&quot;...Fonzy strikes me as a talent as well.<br /> <br /> for movies there are always the classics like &quot;Indiana Jones&quot;, &quot;Back to the Future&quot;...<br /> <br /> related to Warehouse 13 is &quot;Eureka&quot; about a town of super scientists...goldmine!<br /> <br /> I personally enjoyed &quot;Dark Matter&quot; quite a lot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/